From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cicalooo <153059103+cicalooo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:48:46 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add Qwen3.5 9B GDN gating and CausalD256H16Kv4
 attention support

- Add Bf16Gdn9Geometry ([32, 4096]) MMA schedules, kernels, and wrapper
  validation for 9B GDN gating projections.
- Add CausalD256H16Kv4 (16 query heads / 4 KV heads) causal softmax
  attention geometry and pass kv_heads where query-head count overlaps
  with CausalD256H16Kv2.
- Allow non-BF16 encoded block formats in tools/convert/gguf_blocks.py
  gdn_control_source (dequantized to BF16).
